<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57" title="View the profile of Givins">Givins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 116<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://mark.scns.com/eq/givins.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Illuminating mobs since 2001<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=5226347" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=5226347&amp;img=5" alt="5226347" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:ktadema@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=198.msg831#msg831"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=198.msg831#msg831">Frustrated by Bloodmaw!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> May 08, 2003, 01:47:40 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I literally spent 40 minutes this morning trying to get Bloodmaw in the Great Divide to accept my Tizmak meat. &nbsp;I tried to get BARELY in range of Bloodmaw without aggroing, as I'd heard to do. &nbsp;The VERY first time I tried, the trade window opened but Bloodmaw aggro'd. &nbsp;I backed up and tried again, A BUNCH of times, to no avail. &nbsp;I began to try a plethora of approaches. &nbsp;I camped a bunch of times to remove aggro, I crouched as I approached, I approached from several different directions, I tried to click on different parts of Bloodmaw's body and appendages (got kinky and quit), but I never got the trade window to pop up again, and every single time, I would eventually get too close and Blood would attack. &nbsp;<br /><br />What did you melee guys do to get Bloodmaw to take my meat, so to speak.... 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Klozz 65th level Warrior, Givins N&#039;Takhiens, 65th level Wizard
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg832"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52" title="View the profile of Gabus">Gabus</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 268<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/psychotic-day.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I beat the Internet. The end guy was hard.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=198.msg832#msg832"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=198.msg832#msg832">Re:Frustrated by Bloodmaw!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> May 08, 2003, 08:46:23 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							My guess is Enchanter charm.. It works for other quests. <br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
