								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=198.msg867#msg867">Re:Frustrated by Bloodmaw!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> May 12, 2003, 08:27:21 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If I remember right, in one of the past couple patches, they changed the aggro on Bloodmaw for the turn in. &nbsp;It requires help from an enchanter or another class of that sort now. &nbsp;Hope this helps.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
