								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=198.msg1058#msg1058">Re:Frustrated by Bloodmaw!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> June 02, 2003, 01:59:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Take a druid or ranger down there with you and have them &quot;calm animal&quot;. &nbsp;I did this for a warrior friend of mine, just casted &nbsp;&quot;calm animal&quot; till bloodmaw con'd indifferent.<br /><br />Diamsorn<br />61 Warder <br />Menacing Visage
